1
00:00:00,060 --> 00:00:04,030
(Leonard:)Friends overlook
each other's minor lapses.

2
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:08,040
(Leonard:)For the record, Howard, I'm
sorry that I broke our pact.

3
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,360
Thank you.

4
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:13,190
(Howard:)And I'm sorry
about your phone

5
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:15,010
(Howard:)and Thanksgiving.

6
00:00:15,010 --> 00:00:16,380
(Howard:)And while we're at it,

7
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:18,820
(Howard:)you don't have to wash our
clothes on the Fourth of July.

8
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:22,370
As long as we're apologizing,

9
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:25,620
Sheldon, I'm, I'm sorry
I used your toothbrush.

10
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:27,860
(Howard:)And I'm sorry...

11
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,360
but that behavior
is beyond the pale

12
00:00:29,360 --> 00:00:31,030
(Sheldon:)and cannot be tolerated.

13
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:33,160
(Sheldon:)We are no longer friends.

14
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:37,200
(Raj:)I got you a talking Thomas the
Tank Engine for Thanksgiving.

15
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,170
(Sheldon:)With real puffing smoke?

16
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:41,400
(Howard:)Yes.

17
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:43,720
All right.

18
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:47,740
(Sheldon:)But I'm watching you.

19
00:01:01,020 --> 00:01:02,470
Hey, you've got Snoopy out.

20
00:01:02,470 --> 00:01:03,680
Can I have a snow cone?

21
00:01:03,680 --> 00:01:06,550
(Sheldon:)Well, sure.

22
00:01:08,490 --> 00:01:09,470
This is pretty good.

23
00:01:09,470 --> 00:01:10,760
What flavor is this?

24
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:13,660
(Raj:)Guess.

25
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:15,260
(Leonard:)Papaya?
No.

26
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:17,900
(Leonard:)Guava?
You're so close.

27
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:18,900
(Leonard:)I give up.

28
00:01:18,900 --> 00:01:21,300
(Sheldon:)Mango caterpillar.

29
00:01:23,290 --> 00:01:24,560
(Leonard:)What are
you doing?!

30
00:01:27,290 --> 00:01:29,030
(Sheldon:)You said you
liked it.

